    "body": "## WORKSTREAM A — SHERIFF LAW INGEST / A-SCOPE EFFECT\n\n**ROLE**\nWORKSTREAM A — CHARACTER / COSTUME -> POSE\n\n**TASK / TRACKER**\n#249 / active gate #248 `COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01`\n\n**BASE / HEAD**\n- fresh `main` = `b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1`\n- fresh studio branch HEAD = `53333c46a856243c62c7bfc2e3f7a19b7c721566`\n\n**RESULT**\n- OWNER supplied `ZORR SHERIFF — UNIVERSAL THREE-CHAT LAW R01` in the current session.\n- Source file SHA256 = `4a9ae8a4362af8fc2ea827a765fa8960f01ecea215fc4c6bb3449553106a9908`.\n- WORKSTREAM A applies the A-relevant fail-closed rules immediately: fresh-state restore, one active gate, artifact>activity, stop spec/infra expansion when it does not close a product gap, image-authority law, first-broken-layer law, no competing locks, and MASTER-only cross-workstream promotion.\n\n**DELTA**\n- Further costume-spec/protocol expansion is stopped. The mechanics matrix + witness execution protocol are sufficient non-visual preparation.\n- No CAMERA/WORLD/S001 authority is claimed from branch HEAD `53333c46...`; that commit is treated as independent Workstream B preparation only.\n\n**EVIDENCE**\n- #248 remains open and still states image generation/editing requires separate exact OWNER authorization.\n- Existing #248 evidence still states `SIX_COSTUME_MECHANICS_VISUAL_WITNESSES = NOT AUTHORIZED / NOT PRESENT`.\n- Exact universal SHERIFF law title was not found in current repository code search, so CHAT A does not silently claim that the full universal law body is already durable/canonical in GitHub.\n\n**OPEN / BLOCKER**\n- `COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01 != PASS`.\n- `IMAGE EXECUTION = BLOCKED` until exact OWNER visual authority exists.\n- Universal-law canonical GitHub persistence/promotion is a MASTER/OWNER authority matter, not an A production lock.\n\n**NEXT LEGAL STEP**\nFor A: `EXACT OWNER VISUAL AUTHORITY -> W01..W06 -> SELF-QA -> FRESH EVIDENCE -> #248 PASS/FAIL`.\n\nNo further spec/infra expansion in A while this is the first real gap.",
